    "detailed_description": "<strong>Spell Sweeper is a puzzle game which based on &quot;Minesweeper&quot;.</strong><br>You get summon by &quot;Square&quot; country and fight against &quot;Sphere&quot; country as a Hero.<br>Your goal is to defeat the BOSS!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How To Fight?</h2> Fighting is so simple. <br><br>1: Open squares and Place flags on spells.<br>2: Then start attack!<br>When you open enemy spell, you just lose your &quot;PP&quot;!<br>\u3000No need to worry about mistake!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill and PP</h2> In this game there are &quot;Skill&quot; and &quot;PP(Pride Point)&quot;<br><br>* By using &quot;Skill&quot;, you can see inside of unopen square.<br>* Hero has a &quot;PP&quot; and if you lose too much &quot;PP&quot;, you will die.<br>\u3000  So Be Careful!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get EXP! And Level Up!</h2> You will get &quot;EXP&quot; after win each battle. <br><br>And each time level up, you get +1 PP!<br><br>Get strong and try defeat the BOSS!",
